Note on scope / 关于范围的说明

This license covers the source code and documentation in this repository.
It does NOT cover third-party trademarks, vendor CAD libraries, or the
output of the EDA toolchain (Gerber / BOM / PnP files), whose terms are set
by the respective manufacturers and EDA vendors.

Board designs under `designs/` and fabrication output under `out/` are
provided as-is for reproduction and research. **No board produced by this
project has been physically manufactured or electrically validated.**
Do not order a board without an independent review.
